      "value": "I'd argue that the responsibility for this kind of thing falls on the instance creator, not the people joining.\n\nIf you're going to discuss private topics or show non-stream friendly content then you should be doing it in invite only worlds, not leaving yourself open for anyone (friends list or otherwise) to join.",
