      "value": "@{5b68fbeec52d7b606b4182ec|full_name}: if you don't want people \"making money off you\" then make it a private only world that only specific people you invite can join. Also saying \"hey please don't make money off of me\" sounds kind of narcissistic, so by that logic does any streamer who goes to Shonzo's avatar world owe him some of their streaming revenue because they are \"making money off of him\"?\n\nVRChat is supposed to be a social gathering simulator to allow people to showcase creations and make friends. Not \"close yourself in a box and tell everyone to stop looking at what you've made\" simulator. If you don't want exposure to your creations then don't give people a platform to expose it on (aka make the world private).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
