      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "From my perspective this is something down to the instance creator. It's called a private instance. If you're in a friends+ instance and expecting that level of personally tailored privacy, you're simply in the wrong place. If you're in a friends instance (only your own friends) then this is a matter between you and your individual friends to discuss. \n\nBesides, the types of more inconsiderate streamers that you complain of in your other comment here, would have no obligation not to stream regardless of any messages, and would likely only see it as a sign that there's something interesting to snoop on occurring. You'd only be advertising to them, yet still powerless to stop them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
