      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ac115035624005f3577dd32|full_name}: We had a friend get banned after a streamer joined off a friend of hers, no idea who, in a private world. The streamer was not invited or welcome, and when she reported our friend she made it seem like it was happening a public world. She made a huge deal of it, had her viewers also report it, then made a follow up video to fundraise off it, pretending to be a victim.\n\nSo yeah, it can be an issue, especially with the new tos that essentially bans lap dancing and other non puritanical behavior. Remember to go to church at least 8 days a week, kids.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
